# Amy start - MineHQ style packet access
# SaLib / SwordArt (PotPvP) build scoreboard teams, boss bars and entity metadata packets
# by hand, which needs these vanilla fields writable. Both the relocated and the
# pre-relocation class names are listed so the mapping applies no matter which
# build step consumes it.
